// Longarm worker API (served by longarmd, consumed by longarm / later longarm-hub / longarm-tray).
//
// One proto package, one service per capability area so that later phases add
// services rather than mutate existing ones:
//   P0a: Node, Exec, Jobs, Metrics, Admin
//   P0b: Sessions (named PTY sessions: attach/detach/resize, ConPTY / pty),
//        Forward (one bidi byte stream per forwarded TCP connection, plus the
//        stream behind `longarm proxy` into the built-in sshd), Files (chunked
//        read/write with offsets + sha256 for resumable transfers), Workspace
//        (git mirror + worktree sync).
//
// Transport-agnostic: everything runs over gRPC + app-level mTLS on top of a
// net.Conn supplied by a Transport backend (tcp / tailscale tsnet / longnet).
// Authorization is by the role embedded in the caller's certificate, and -
// with multi-tenancy - by ownership: jobs, sessions, files and forwards
// belong to the caller's user (docs/security.md).

